From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Armbian <armbian@localhost>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 07:20:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] tb-ls3399: enter download on either volume key

Factory vol-up is SARADC ~170, vol-down is ~1. Accept both so the
silkscreen Volume+ and the near-ground key can enter rockusb.

---
 arch/arm/mach-rockchip/boot_rkimg.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/boot_rkimg.c b/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/boot_rkimg.c
--- a/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/boot_rkimg.c
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/boot_rkimg.c
@@ -302,7 +302,8 @@ __weak int rockchip_dnl_key_pressed(void)
 {
 #if defined(CONFIG_DM_KEY)
-	return key_is_pressed(key_read(KEY_VOLUMEUP));
+	return key_is_pressed(key_read(KEY_VOLUMEUP)) ||
+	       key_is_pressed(key_read(KEY_VOLUMEDOWN));
 
 #elif defined(CONFIG_ADC)
 	const void *blob = gd->fdt_blob;
 	int node, ret, channel = 1;
